graph TD
    subgraph Kernel["DEOS Kernel (headless, deterministic, Q32.32, zero-allocation)"]
        IL[(Input Log<br/>CatalystAction records in tick,seq order<br/>Checkpoints every CHECKPOINT_INTERVAL)] --> S1
        S1[Stage 1: Ingress<br/>apply Input Log entries for this tick] --> S2
        S2[Stage 2: Substrate<br/>conservation, diffusion, thermodynamics, material decay] --> S3
        S3[Stage 3: Biology<br/>metabolism, Lifecycle, reproduction, Genome inheritance] --> S4
        S4[Stage 4: Cognition<br/>Perception, utility scoring, Decision + Decision Trace, Memory] --> S5
        S5[Stage 5: Society<br/>Meme-Vector transmission, trust, Institutions, technology] --> S6
        S6[Stage 6: Commit<br/>command resolution, Chunk Hashes, Tick Hash, Chronicle flush, buffer swap, egress]
        S6 -->|Tick Hash every tick| CK[Checkpoint every 64 ticks]
        CK -.->|appended| IL
        S6 -->|every SNAPSHOT_INTERVAL| SN[(Snapshot)]
    end

    subgraph Host["Host: Emergence: The Digital Rise"]
        S6 -->|read-only buffer swap| OV[Observation View<br/>Particles, Living Diagram, Network Map]
        S6 -->|Chronicle egress: NotableEvent stream| CH[Chronicle<br/>Living History with cause drill-down]
        S6 -->|WorldMood egress| AU[Generative audio<br/>harmony and dissonance]
        CP[Catalyst Palette<br/>Climate, Resource, Mutation, Cosmic] -->|CatalystAction appended| IL
        TC[Time Control<br/>SPEED_LEVELS, Acceleration catch-up] -->|host commands| IL
    end

    subgraph Share["Sharing and verification"]
        IL -->|Master Seed + Input Log| SW[Shared world, challenge submission]
        SW -->|re-simulate, compare Checkpoints| VF[Verifier]
        SN -->|Seed Lineage| SW
    end
